  "label": "Maternal Mortality",
  "description": "The meme implicitly references maternal mortality, which is the death of a woman while pregnant or within 42 days of termination of pregnancy, irrespective of the cause. This is a global public health issue, particularly prevalent in low-resource settings. The text’s reference to a wife dying in childbirth requires knowledge of this medical and social concept to be fully understood.",
